From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Tambe <tambewilliam@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 11:49:18 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] misc: Add the default device of the FonTamSOC

The default device of the FonTamSOC acknowledges the accesses to
unmapped addresses, and raises its interrupt: the address, which its
register holds, is reported. The register, the last word of the address
space, lies within the range of the error pointers: it is mapped without
devm_platform_ioremap_resource().

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: William Tambe <tambewilliam@gmail.com>
